 "result": "I documented 11 repos this run and pushed all of them. The other four repos with commits after their last documented point only had their state refreshed.\n\nThe four backfills were bloxx, repo-cloner, 2026-11-17-orange-campus and 2026-11-17-orange-campusapi. Seven existing repos got new changelog or release entries: pipe-weave, mobbyhill, raineurysm, pajamastan, mohavetech-website, the test bed and the score hub. Field-twin, shared-server, blue-agent and itchy-troll only had helper scripts or small tweaks, so their last-documented commit was refreshed and nothing else changed. I did not check the live sites after the pushes, and I did not look at how the new repos deploy beyond confirming none of them keeps its app in a subfolder.\n\nThe profile page in sudosilo/sudosilo and the scribe state in control-troll are both pushed. The release jobs are in scribe/publish.json for the publish workflow to run.\n\nBackfills left in the queue are control-troll, heckle-troll and sudosilo, which earlier notes say to skip on purpose. I could reach every repo.\n\nI did not condense agents/notes/general.md. It is far past the 40-line limit, and I only added one note to it.",
